  <item>
    <title>Here we go: New England for the Fall Colors!</title>
    <link>https://hobobiker-prep.ddev.site/here_we_go_new_england_for_the_fall_colors</link>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;OK! We have tickets and this trip is going to happen! We fly to Manchester, New Hampshire this coming Wednesday, and start riding on Thursday. We&#039;ll be posting our adventures and pictures as we go and get a chance.&lt;/p&gt;
