  <item>
    <title>Budgeting</title>
    <link>https://hobobiker-prep.ddev.site/budgeting</link>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re starting to keep closer and closer track of our budget, because we want to make a realistic budget for the big trip (from the Arctic Circle to the bottom of South America) which we hope to start next year (in 2006!). &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So here&#039;s our budget for this one. We&#039;ll see how we do. We&#039;re figuring about $20/day/person. That will come out to about $400/person (not including airfare or shipping the bikes both ways). Hopefully we can do it!&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
