  <item>
    <title>Route Change!</title>
    <link>https://hobobiker-prep.ddev.site/route_change</link>
    <description>Well, Nancy kept insisting on finding those colors, so we just
kept heading north and more north until we went into Canada.
So our original route is nothing like what we&#039;ve done. We followed up Maine, New Hampshire, and Vermont into Quebec, and now will come back down through Vermont to (hopefully) catch our plane in a week.</description>
